
BRAND GUIDELINES: SEVASETU

1) BRAND SUMMARY

Personality: clear, patient, respectful, trustworthy, warm.

Never feel like: a government form, a sales funnel, or a legal advisor.

Positioning: SevaSetu helps every eligible citizen understand and claim the public benefits they are owed, in their own language.

2) COLOR SYSTEM

Light theme (default)

Backgrounds: base #F6F4EE, surface #FDFCF8, elevated #FFFEFB.
Text: primary #1C2330, secondary #46505F, muted #5C6573.
Border and dividers: #D9D4C7.
Accent (primary): #0F6B63, hover #0B5A53.
Semantic: success #17693A, warning #8A4B08, error #B42318, info #1E4FA3.

Dark theme (follows the system setting)

Backgrounds: base #15181E, surface #1D2129, elevated #262B35.
Text: primary #EEF1F5, secondary #C3CAD6, muted #A4ADBC.
Border and dividers: #353B47.
Accent (primary): #5FC7BC, hover #7DD8CE.
Semantic: success #6CD195, warning #F2B45A, error #FF8A80, info #8DB6FF.

Contrast rules
Primary text on base or surface must reach at least 12:1.
Secondary and muted text is for base and surface only, at 4.5:1 or higher.
White text appears only on the accent color.
Never use color alone to convey meaning. Pair it with text or an icon.

3) TYPOGRAPHY

Primary font: Noto Sans. It covers Latin, Telugu (Noto Sans Telugu), and Devanagari (Noto Sans Devanagari) with consistent weight.
Fallback stack: "Noto Sans", "Noto Sans Telugu", "Noto Sans Devanagari", system-ui, sans-serif.
Amounts: same family, with tabular numerals and weight 600 so columns align.

Type scale:
H1: 28px, line height 36px, weight 700.
H2: 22px, line height 30px, weight 600.
H3: 19px, line height 26px, weight 600.
Body: 17px, line height 26px, weight 400.
Small: 16px, line height 24px, weight 400.

Sixteen pixels is the minimum size anywhere in the app.
Use one H1 per page.
Use Body for explanations and Small for source notes.
Never set body text in all caps.

4) SPACING AND LAYOUT

Spacing scale (px): 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48.
Mobile: single column, 16px side margins, one task per screen.
Desktop (900px and up): centered container, 960px maximum width, 24px gutters.
Cards: 20px padding on mobile, 24px on desktop, 16px corner radius.
Elevation: a 1px border plus a faint shadow (0 1px 2px rgba(28, 35, 48, 0.06)). No gradients or glow.

5) COMPONENTS

Primary button: accent background, white text, 48px minimum height, 12px radius. Hover uses the accent-hover color. Focus-visible shows a 3px accent ring with a 2px offset. Disabled is 40% opacity. While loading, show a label such as "Checking eligibility…", not just a spinner.

Secondary button: elevated background, 1px border, primary text.

Ghost button: no background, accent text, underline on hover.

Destructive button: error text with a border. Requires a confirmation step.

Text, number, date, and select inputs: 48px minimum height, 16px text, 1.5px border. Labels stay visible at all times. Never use placeholders as labels. Errors use an error border, an icon, and text linked with aria-describedby.

Category and answer chips: 44px minimum height, pill shape. Selected state uses an accent border, a check icon, and the word "Selected".

Scheme cards: surface background, border, and shadow. Each card shows a status chip, the scheme name, and a one-line reason.

Status chips: "Likely eligible" uses success with a check icon. "Possibly eligible" uses info with a question icon. "Check with office" uses warning with an info icon.

List rows (documents and steps): 56px minimum height, label on the left, status on the right.

Modal or drawer: elevated background, scrim at rgba(21, 24, 30, 0.6). Focus is trapped inside. Esc closes it, and focus returns to the trigger.

Toast: elevated background, bottom of the screen, role="status", visible for at least 5 seconds.

6) ICONOGRAPHY AND IMAGERY

Icons use a 24px grid, a 2px outline stroke, and round caps and joins. Pair every icon with a text label.

Use real photos only with consent. Do not use state emblems, government seals, flags, or stock photos of officials. These cues could make users think SevaSetu is an official service.

7) MOTION

Timing: 120 to 200ms. Easing: cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1).
Animate only opacity and transform.
Reduced motion: remove transforms and keep only opacity changes under 100ms. Do not use auto-playing animation. Replace spinners with static "Working…" text.

8) ACCESSIBILITY CHECKLIST

Focus: always show a 3px accent ring. Never remove outlines.
Contrast: meet the ratios in section 2.
Hit targets: at least 44px, with 48px preferred.
Keyboard: tab order follows the visual order. Enter and Space operate controls. Esc closes modals. The voice button is reachable by keyboard.
Screen readers: results and errors use aria-live="polite". Each page has one H1 and logical headings.
Text resizes to 200% without losing content.

